#: Perf.md:1
msgid "Flamegraph with perf from plumed benchmark"
msgstr "plumed benchmark の perf による Flamegraph"

#: Perf.md:3
msgid ""
"Flamegraphs provide you with a way for visualising how long is spent in each"
" of the functions that make up a large piece of software like PLUMED. "
"Constructing these graphs is a useful way to identify bottlenecks in codes "
"and ways of optimising your calculations."
msgstr ""
"Flamegraphs は、PLUMED のような大きなソフトウェアの各関数に、どれだけ時間がかかっているかを可視化する。コードの "
"Bottlenecks と、計算を最適化する方法の特定に役立つ。"

#: Perf.md:6
msgid ""
"The best way to understand how to create a flame graph is by looking at the "
"[original "
"site](https://www.brendangregg.com/FlameGraphs/cpuflamegraphs.html). A step-"
"by-step instruction guide can be found on that site (this step by step guide"
" is for linux. Mac OS user can follow some links "
"[here](https://www.brendangregg.com/flamegraphs.html)):"
msgstr ""
"Flame Graph "
"の作り方を理解するには、[元のサイト](https://www.brendangregg.com/FlameGraphs/cpuflamegraphs.html)を見るのがよい。Linux"
" 用の手順ガイドがある。macOS "
"の利用者は[こちら](https://www.brendangregg.com/flamegraphs.html)のリンクも参照できる。"

#: Perf.md:9
msgid "Before working through the step by step guides above you should:"
msgstr "上の手順を進める前に、次を行う。"

#: Perf.md:10
msgid "ensure you have enough permission to run processes with perf"
msgstr "perf で Processes を実行するのに十分な権限があることを確認する。"

#: Perf.md:11
msgid ""
"recompile plumed with `CXXFLAGS='-O3 -g -fno-omit-frame-pointer' CFLAGS=\"-g"
" -O2 -fno-omit-frame-pointer\" ./configure other options` [-fno-omit-frame-"
"pointer](https://www.brendangregg.com/FlameGraphs/cpuflamegraphs.html#C) is "
"necessary on linux to correctly time the functions (you can use also "
"`-gdwarf` instead of `-g`)"
msgstr ""
"`CXXFLAGS='-O3 -g -fno-omit-frame-pointer' CFLAGS=\"-g -O2 -fno-omit-frame-"
"pointer\" ./configure other options` で PLUMED を再コンパイルする。Linux で関数の時間を正しく測るには"
" [-fno-omit-frame-"
"pointer](https://www.brendangregg.com/FlameGraphs/cpuflamegraphs.html#C) "
"が必要である。`-g` の代わりに `-gdwarf` も使える。"

#: Perf.md:12
msgid "do the same also with all the kernels you want to measure"
msgstr "測定するすべての Kernels も同様に再コンパイルする。"

#: Perf.md:13
msgid ""
"clone the repository `git clone "
"https://github.com/brendangregg/FlameGraph.git`, or download the release"
msgstr ""
"`git clone https://github.com/brendangregg/FlameGraph.git` "
"でリポジトリを取得するか、Release をダウンロードする。"

#: Perf.md:14
msgid "save the path of the repository (I saved it as `flameDir`)"
msgstr "リポジトリのパスを保存する。著者は `flameDir` に保存した。"

#: Perf.md:15
msgid "run the benchmark with perf:"
msgstr "perf で Benchmark を実行する。"

#: Perf.md:20
msgid "then post process with perf :"
msgstr "次に perf で後処理する。"

#: Perf.md:24
msgid "before you post process with the flamegraphs utilities:"
msgstr "続いて Flamegraphs の Utilities で後処理する。"

#: Perf.md:29
msgid ""
"You can then open the flamegraph. You should see something similar to the "
"graph shown below."
msgstr "Flamegraph を開くと、次のような図が見られるはずである。"

# Bibliographic title, software value, file path or image-only markup
# intentionally preserved.
#: Perf.md:31
msgid "![](benchmark-school-perf.svg)"
msgstr "![](benchmark-school-perf.svg)"

#: Perf.md:34
msgid ""
"When reading a flame graph remember: the functions are horizontally in "
"alphabetical order. The horizontal space is the percent of time that the "
"function occupies in time and the height of the rectangle is the stack depth"
" in which that function has been measured."
msgstr ""
"Flame Graph の関数は、横方向にアルファベット順で並ぶ。幅はその関数が占める時間の割合、矩形の高さは測定した Stack Depth を表す。"

#: Perf.md:37
msgid ""
"For example in the column on the right where the base is \"_start\" you can "
"see that of all the functions calls in the stack of \"mca_base*\" basically "
"all the time is occupied by the \"do_lookup_x\" on the top of that stack."
msgstr ""
"例えば、右側の _start を底とする列では、mca_base* の Stack の関数呼び出しのうち、ほぼすべての時間を上端の "
"do_lookup_x が占めることが分かる。"

#: Perf.md:39
msgid ""
"If you open the svg with a browser you can click on the individual functions"
" to zoom in. There is also a search utility when the graph is opened with a "
"browser."
msgstr "SVG をブラウザで開くと、個々の関数をクリックして拡大できる。検索機能も使える。"
